AndPull com cta_conta).", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "SITE_MAP.md", "source_location": "L690"}, {"id": "c_users_isaia_downloads_brands_lutas_de_ilus\u00e3o_siteldi_site_map_arenatestbed_engine_eventbus_js_singleton_pub_sub_on_off_emit_integrado_ao_useeffectmachine_ouvinte_effect_end_effectrenderer_emite_de_primitivos_phase6combatv2_onclearhighlight_highlights_usecombatengine_finalizarturnoia_substitui_chamadas_diretas_a_finalizarefeito_por_emit_effect_end_canal", "label": "ArenaTestbed engine/eventBus.js: Singleton pub/sub (on/off/emit). Integrado ao useEffectMachine (ouvinte `effect:end`), EffectRenderer (emite de primitivos), Phase6CombatV2 (`onClearHighlight`/highlights), useCombatEngine (`finalizarTurnoIA`). Substitui chamadas diretas a `finalizarEfeito` por `emit('effect:end', { canal })`.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "SITE_MAP.md", "source_location": "L692"}, {"id": "c_users_isaia_downloads_brands_lutas_de_ilus\u00e3o_siteldi_site_map_deploy_npm_run_build_npm_run_deploy_gh_pages_python_deploy_py_g_game_m_desc_para_automa\u00e7\u00e3o_completa", "label": "Deploy: `npm run build` \u2192 `npm run deploy` (gh-pages). `python deploy.py -g <game> -m \"desc\"` para automa\u00e7\u00e3o completa.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "SITE_MAP.md", "source_location": "L694"}, {"id": "c_users_isaia_downloads_brands_lutas_de_ilus\u00e3o_siteldi_site_map_pend\u00eancias_t\u00e9cnicas_n\u00e3o_urgentes", "label": "Pend\u00eancias t\u00e9cnicas (n\u00e3o urgentes)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "SITE_MAP.md", "source_location": "L701"}], "edges": [{"source": "c_users_isaia_downloads_brands_lutas_de_ilus\u00e3o_siteldi_site_map_md", "target": "c_users_isaia_downloads_brands_lutas_de_ilus\u00e3o_siteldi_site_map_illusionfight_com_site_map", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "SITE_MAP.md", "source_location": "L1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "c_users_isaia_downloads_brands_lutas_de_ilus\u00e3o_siteldi_site